\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces KBEmacs, running in 2026, replaying the first half of the SQRT sequence from its December 14, 1984 self-test. The generated code is \texttt  {equal} to the code recorded in 1984. (\texttt  {//} is Zetalisp's division operator.) The final lines are KBEmacs's own description of the program, generated from its plan, as recorded in the 1984 self-test (abridged).}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:sqrt}{{3}{7}{KBEmacs, running in 2026, replaying the first half of the SQRT sequence from its December 14, 1984 self-test. The generated code is \texttt {equal} to the code recorded in 1984. (\texttt {//} is Zetalisp's division operator.) The final lines are KBEmacs's own description of the program, generated from its plan, as recorded in the 1984 self-test (abridged)}{figure.3}{}}
